1. Create a trigger to handle inserts to the product relation ( if price < 5 the set price to 10).

mysql> DELIMITER $$
mysql> CREATE TRIGGER set_price
    -> BEFORE INSERT ON product
    -> FOR EACH ROW
    -> BEGIN
    -> IF NEW.price < 5 THEN
    -> SET NEW.price = 10;
    -> END IF;
    -> END $$
Query OK, 0 rows affected (0.19 sec)


